{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Divine Wish",
    "steam_appid": 3126200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.poster.avif?t=1755203831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.webm?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.mp4?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.poster.avif?t=1755203831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.webm?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.mp4?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.poster.avif?t=1755203831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.webm?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/0a4703e91b9fd4f8879b31469f451f44.mp4?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Wish</strong> is a first-person roguelike shooter with a unique sticker system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in the surge of battle, choose stickers that change your abilities and characteristics, and compete against waves of enemies in a dynamic FPS roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.poster.avif?t=1755203831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.webm?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126200/extras/67007f74225999ee4b2a8cc46b4543b7.mp4?t=1755203831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS + roguelike: an explosive mix</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is a high-speed first-person shooter where each run is a unique challenge. Explore random combinations of weapons and artifacts, adapt to new threats, and prove your skills in boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed, reaction, and accuracy are key skills for your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No saves - every death brings you back to the beginning, but with a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is unique thanks to a system of classes and random artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stickers that change your abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classic character classes in Divine Wish - you choose how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each race, you get a sticker that gives you unique effects and changes the gameplay. But it's not that simple - each sticker gives you both a powerful bonus and a weakness, so you have to choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10th wave is an epic boss battle that will test your skills to the brim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique attacks and mechanics make you adapt to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gradual increase in difficulty ensures that you will not have an easy time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the best players will be able to defeat all the bosses and complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in any roguelike, each run is a chance to become stronger. Explore enemies, experiment with stickers, and find your perfect playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Wish is an explosive combination of roguelike and FPS. Ready to take on the challenge?</p>",
    "short_description": "Divine Wish is a fast-paced roguelike shooter with various classes and special abilities. Find your play style, survive waves of enemies, and use artifacts to change the tides of the battle. Die, learn, adapt!",
